      "translation_input": "Le 18 octobre 2025, une tempête de poussière a réduit la production solaire de 34 % en quinze minutes La température de l'armoire de batteries a augmente de 8 °C, tandis que le ventilateur de l'onduleur produisait une vibration anormale Au lieu d'arrêter la station. le système a coupe le chauffage secondaire, réduit certains éclairages et démarré le groupe de secours Il a identifié trois causes possibles des débris sur les panneaux, un roulement usé et une résistance croissante dans un connecteur de batterie",
      "translated_text": "On 18 October 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34% in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery cabinet rose by 8 °C, while the inverter fan produced an abnormal vibration instead of shutting down the station. The system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights, and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn bearing, and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "On 18 October 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34% in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery cabinet rose by 8 °C, while the inverter fan produced an abnormal vibration instead of shutting down the station. The system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lights, and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of the debris on the panels, a worn bearing, and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "spell_changes": []
